{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15937","headline":"送韦处士老舅 · 王建","name":"送韦处士老舅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昨痴小年，不知有经籍。\n常随童子游，多向外家剧。\n偷花入邻里，弄笔书墙壁。\n照水学梳头，应门未穿帻。\n人前赏文性，棃果蒙不惜。\n赋字咏新泉，探题得幽石。\n自从出关辅，三十年作客。\n风雨一飘颻，亲情多阻隔。\n如何二千里，尘土驱蹇瘠。\n良久陈苦辛，从头叹衰白。\n既来今又去，暂笑还成戚。\n落日动征车，春风卷离席。\n云台观西路，华岳祠前柏。\n会得过帝乡，重寻旧行蹟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}